            "created_at": "2025-09-17T15:40:49.706088+00:00",
            "notes": "I like [Circuit Breaker](item_ee0bd3b8-4c0d-40e6-a2a2-be20deef0e19) first but [Electro Cluster](item_2ce040d2-6b47-4be6-83b3-f8266c2c2b48) is also a valid choice since we will be taking it round 3 anyways.\n\n[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) are must picks for the effective 10% WP r1. If you're taking [Circuit Breaker](item_ee0bd3b8-4c0d-40e6-a2a2-be20deef0e19) get [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418), if you're taking [Electro Cluster](item_2ce040d2-6b47-4be6-83b3-f8266c2c2b48) then buy [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) instead to give you some of that missing sustain. \n\nYou can greed with [Winton](item_1c8c3f53-4ed4-417f-a3b2-e7c52bda907a) if you think the matchup is favourable like playing into [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000), [Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46) and [Sigma](hero_646d9571-c40a-4403-b6c1-fb67adb6112d) but I wouldn't recommend in 95% of games.",
