            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-17T15:40:50.49441+00:00",
            "notes": "Round three is your big powerspike with the extra range letting you chase even longer and helping [Circuit Breaker](item_ee0bd3b8-4c0d-40e6-a2a2-be20deef0e19) give more overshield.\n\nYou can fully ditch [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418) now because you have movespeed and extra range, the cash is better spent on raw stats. Aim for [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and upgrade [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) to [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) if you have the cash.  \n\nR3 is where you can start to afford counterpicking with your items if you need to.\n[Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) if enemies are running lots of status effects.\n[Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) if enemies have natural shield/armour e.g. [Juno](hero_035c63b7-084c-4abd-9de5-c9a00e9b6a18) and [Sigma](hero_646d9571-c40a-4403-b6c1-fb67adb6112d). This stacks well with the extra range of [Electro Cluster](item_2ce040d2-6b47-4be6-83b3-f8266c2c2b48).\n[Smart-Armor](item_2e0f4a99-c818-49c1-ace2-ba8d6f282da8) if enemies have shotgun burst that is giving you too much trouble, or [Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) if they have a [Cassidy](hero_3dd63854-7558-4344-86e4-b506f807129b)/[Zenyatta](hero_3c4002ee-e694-48ed-9730-70fd48773317) consistently headshotting you.",
