            "notes": "R4 is for buying [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) for the CDR so you can bubble more ready for round 5.\n\nIf you want more sustain through fights rather than bubbles you can go for [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f). You can Proc the debuff on multiple enemies which helps live in fights and slows down enemy healing too. \n\nDon't forget the counterpick items like [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) if the AP builds are now doing lots of damage.",
